# @rustok/__ROUTE__-admin

The Next Admin workspace for the __SLUG__ module. The package exports a
server-paginated record workspace and a settings page for host composition.
Record reads, writes and publication use the owner GraphQL documents.
Settings use the shared static lifecycle contract. The host supplies
authenticated request context and localized application messages.

- src/model.ts narrows route state and models localized records.
- src/operations.ts is generated from the same documents as the Leptos package.
- src/transport.ts binds the host GraphQL client to those operations.
- src/pages/ loads the package surfaces using host-provided credentials.
- src/components/ uses the standard table, form controls and settings editor.

For `--ui admin`, the generator installs the package routes at
`/dashboard/__ROUTE__`, `/records`, `/settings`, and `/settings/records` under
that module root. The host's module guard and navigation availability policy
use the owner slug. For `--ui dual`, the package is a preview while the
storefront surface is in development.
